..{\bm{x}}_{L}}p_{g_{\phi}}({\bm{x}}_{0:L}\mid{\mathbf{q}})\frac{r({\mathbf{q}},{\bm{x}}_{0})}{\mathrm{std}_{g_{\phi_{\rm old}}}({\mathbf{q}})+\epsilon}\bigl]\biggl]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
